     4069   Filter-Block:
     4070   DO ON STOP    UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     4071       ON ERROR   UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     4072       ON END-KEY UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block :
